# No Laravel Pail

Do not add, install, or use Laravel Pail in this project.

- Do not add `laravel/pail` to `composer.json`
- Do not run `php artisan pail`
- Do not add Pail to Composer scripts (including `composer dev`)
- Use Laravel log files or `tail` on `storage/logs` if log streaming is needed
